WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.665
Open a new temporary chat and upload the chapter PDF.

00:00:04.665 --> 00:00:05.931
ChatGPT reads the uploaded chapter · accelerated.

00:00:05.931 --> 00:00:09.431
Write the prompt · fast typing.

00:00:09.431 --> 00:00:09.762
Send the shortcut as the second message.

00:00:09.762 --> 00:00:12.460
ChatGPT processes the prompt and builds the widget · accelerated.

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:15.964
Inspect the generated widget before using its controls.

00:00:16.116 --> 00:00:20.629
Open the hint before selecting the training outcome.

00:00:20.629 --> 00:00:25.964
Choose that optimisation updates numerical parameters.

00:00:25.964 --> 00:00:29.257
Advance to the second round after reading the feedback.

00:00:29.257 --> 00:00:35.097
Choose the fine-tuning claim to inspect feedback on a common misconception.

00:00:35.097 --> 00:00:39.444
Advance after reading why context use does not establish fine-tuning.

00:00:39.444 --> 00:00:42.729
Open the hint for the final question.

00:00:42.729 --> 00:00:48.200
Choose the controlled comparison with fixed model and settings.

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:54.031
Finish the three rounds and read the score and explanations.

00:00:54.031 --> 00:01:01.015
Start another attempt with the same generated quiz.
